(45 Stat. 1222), it is ordered that all lands owned or con­
trolled by the United States within the following-described
area, comprising 10.252J6 acres, more or less, in Canyon
County, Idaho, be, and they are hereby, reserved and set
apart for the use of the Department of Agriculture, subject
to valid existing rights, as a refuge and breeding ground for
migratory birds and other wildlife: Provided, That any
private- lands within the area described shall become a part
of the refuge hereby established upon the acquisition of title
